Subject: Keep frame buffer addresses as pointers
Origin: Filnix
Upstream-Status: Not submitted

The frame buffer code and its tests offset base pointers through intptr_t
and cast the sums back. Under Fil-C a pointer made from an integer has no
capability, so the first pixel access trapped. Do the same arithmetic on
char pointers.

